%% Sequence 2: pairing a mechanic's tablet with the workshop PC.
sequenceDiagram
  actor Mech as Mechanic
  participant Tablet
  participant Shell as JavaFX shell
  participant API
  participant Kernel
  participant Store as Storage

  Mech->>Shell: add device
  Shell->>Kernel: issue device token
  Kernel->>Store: save device
  Kernel-->>Shell: token
  Shell-->>Mech: QR code with address and token
  Mech->>Tablet: scan QR code
  Tablet->>API: POST /pair
  API->>Kernel: verify token
  Kernel-->>API: device bound to mechanic
  API-->>Tablet: session and WebSocket
